abstract: >
  A practical framework for responsible AI in algorithmic pricing. The
  playbook provides a four-step workflow covering fairness criterion
  selection, fair model design, welfare impact assessment, and deployed
  system auditing. Three reproducible insurance case studies provide
  implementation depth. The framework applies to any sector where
  algorithmic pricing raises fairness concerns.
